"music-consonance descriptor: complete_staff borrows an identity-bearing Staff, considers typed note/ornament/chord/pedal/doubling/voice candidates, checks named per-window MetricThreshold values plus preservation/range/style constraints, and returns a content-bound ConsonancePatch with before/after reports, changed windows, provenance, and the exact SearchReceipt; remove_patch(apply_patch(source, patch), patch) restores source including ids"
